     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">Hi there ggplot-Folks!</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">I&#39;m quite new to &quot;R&quot; and &quot;ggplot&quot; and I have an issue regarding the legend editing. Here is my code. I know, it might not be that elegant it could be, but it works fine for me (but if you have any further suggestions - sharing them would be highly appreciated)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">First of all I load my raw-data, which I gained from an RTCA-experiment:</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">library(gplots)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">mcpd2&lt;-read.xls(&quot;<a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/19497400/Data/20110929_raw_Caco2_copy.xls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dl.dropbox.com/u/19497400/Data/20110929_raw_Caco2_copy.xls&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792376409427000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0gd71pDelw453THEEFDzVd\">http://dl.dropbox.com/u/19497400/Data/20110929_raw_Caco2_copy.xls</a>&quot;,sheet=1)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">Now that I have my data, I&#39;ve got to rename the columns:</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">colnames(mcpd2)&lt;-c(&quot;Time&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;Hours&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M1000_A&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M1000_B&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M1000_C&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0500_A&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0500_B&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height: