"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0025_B&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0025_C&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0010_A&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0010_B&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0010_C&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0001_A&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0001_B&quot;,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   &quot;2M0001_C&quot;</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">                   )</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">Now, I have to normalize to a certain timepoint by typing:</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">mcpd2.s&lt;-</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">as.data.frame(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>sweep(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>data.matrix(mcpd2),</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>2,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>data.matrix(mcpd2)[93,]</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">That done, I pick the concentrations I&#39;d like to plot:</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">pick&lt;-c(&quot;Time&quot;,&quot;01&quot;)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">picked&lt;-unique(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>grep(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>paste(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>pick,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>collapse=&quot;|&quot;</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span>),</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>colnames(mcpd2.s),</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>value=TRUE</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">toPlot&lt;-mcpd2.s[picked]</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">After that I melt the data obtained and make a colsplit with the reshape2-package:</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">melt.M2.a&lt;-melt(toPlot,id.var=&quot;Time&quot;)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">melt.M2&lt;-</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>cbind(</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>melt.M2.a,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>reshape2::colsplit(melt.M2.a$variable,&quot;_&quot;,c(&quot;Treat&quot;,&quot;Replicate&quot;))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">Now the plot can be created:</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">library(ggplot)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">plot.M2&lt;-ggplot(data=melt.M2,aes(x=Time,y=value,group=Treat,color=Treat,fill=Treat))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">plot.M2+</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">  stat_summary(fun.data=&quot;mean_cl_normal&quot;,geom=&quot;smooth&quot;,size=1,alpha=0.1)+</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">  scale_x_continuous(limits=c(0,48))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">And here is where I got stuck. How can I edit the legend, the legend title itself and also what is written within the legend. Is there a way to change &quot;2M0001&quot; into &quot;1µM&quot;. By adding the code line:</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco;min-height:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Monaco\">+guides(fill=guide_legend(title=&quot;title&quot;))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">it just gives me a second legend with the desired title but doesn&#39;t replace the actual one. Also, the colors don&#39;t match with the graph and the legend items are not renamed. Am I missing something?</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">Any hint is highly appreciated.</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">Regards,</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica\">Falko</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:17px;font:normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><br></div></div>"
